window.SOURCE_DOCS = {"order":{"title":"Operation Buffalo Snow","subtitle":"Platoon Operations Order · Officer Candidate School · Time Zone: Local (EST)","paras":[{"id":"1","label":"1.","text":"Situation:","page":1,"level":0},{"id":"1.a","label":"a.","text":"Task Organization: See Annex A","page":1,"level":1},{"id":"1.b","label":"b.","text":"Area Of Interest:","page":1,"level":1},{"id":"1.b.i","label":"i.","text":"Close Air Support: 2 attack helicopters are located at Lawson Army Airfield (16S GA 783 345). Trigger for this is a Platoon sized element maneuvering within the Area of Operations (AO), with a 15 minute response time.","page":1,"level":2},{"id":"1.b.ii","label":"ii.","text":"Artillery: 1 enemy Mortar Firing Point has the ability to range the entire AO. Location is unknown. Trigger for employment is a SQD sized element maneuvering within the AO.","page":1,"level":2},{"id":"1.b.iii","label":"iii.","text":"Reserve: 1 X Olvana Army Force maintains 1 mounted SQD (9-12 personnel) to reinforce the AO. Location (16S GA 2148 8143). Trigger for this is the loss of a TM sized element within the AO. Response time is 15-20 minutes on improved roads within the AO.","page":1,"level":2},{"id":"1.b.iv","label":"iv.","text":"Other: None","page":1,"level":2},{"id":"1.c","label":"c.","text":"Area of Operation:","page":1,"level":1},{"id":"1.c.1","label":"","text":"North: 825 Northing","page":1,"level":2},{"id":"1.c.2","label":"","text":"South: 787 Northing","page":1,"level":2},{"id":"1.c.3","label":"","text":"East: 157 Easting","page":1,"level":2},{"id":"1.c.4","label":"","text":"West: 095 Easting","page":1,"level":2},{"id":"1.d","label":"d.","text":"Terrain:","page":1,"level":1},{"id":"1.d.i","label":"i.","text":"Obstacles: Creek beds, flooded low ground, unmarked erosion ditches and the network of man-made roads and trails are obstacles that will severely hinder dismounted movement throughout the AO. There are no known existing obstacles, however the enemy may employ hasty obstacles using timber and concertina wire.","page":1,"level":2},{"id":"1.d.ii","label":"ii.","text":"Avenues of Approach: Major mounted avenues of approach through the region include Red Diamond RD. and BOX SPRINGS RD. These routes are improved surface roads capable of supporting mounted movement in a staggered column with speeds up to 45 mph. The terrain is generally SEVERLY RESTRICTIVE to mounted forces and UNRESTRICTIVE to dismounted forces","page":1,"level":2},{"id":"1.d.iii","label":"iii.","text":"Key Terrain: K1 is the intersection of Box Springs and Red Diamond Road. (16S GA 1529 8195) K2 Four-way Intersection at 16S GA 1509 8050","page":1,"level":2},{"id":"1.d.iv","label":"iv.","text":"Observation and Fields of Fire: The AO is generally densely vegetated and allows for observation and fields of fire of approximately 50 meters. In the low grounds the vegetation thickens and reduces observation and fields of fire to about 20 meters. The high ground and open areas (along roads and hilltops) allow maximum observation and fields of fire to a maximum distance of 300+ meters.","page":1,"level":2},{"id":"1.d.v","label":"v.","text":"Cover and Concealment: Thick vegetation will provide adequate cover and concealment from enemy observation and small arms fire. The vegetation will not provide cover from enemy indirect fires. Rolling terrain and inter visibility lines can be utilized to conceal movement and provide hasty fighting positions","page":2,"level":2},{"id":"1.e","label":"e.","text":"Weather:","page":2,"level":1},{"id":"1.e.i","label":"i.","text":"Cloud Cover: no significant impact to mission.","page":2,"level":2},{"id":"1.e.ii","label":"ii.","text":"Precipitation: 30% chance of rain in the evening hours and throughout the night.","page":2,"level":2},{"id":"1.e.iii","label":"iii.","text":"Temperature: High- 90 degrees Low- 74 degrees","page":2,"level":2},{"id":"1.e.iv","label":"iv.","text":"Visibility: reduced in the early morning hours due to humidity and fog until approximately 0800 daily","page":2,"level":2},{"id":"1.e.v","label":"v.","text":"Winds: Assessed 3-5 Knots out of the NW.","page":2,"level":2},{"id":"1.f","label":"f.","text":"Enemy Forces","page":2,"level":1},{"id":"1.f.i","label":"i.","text":"Composition, Disposition, and Strength:","page":2,"level":2},{"id":"1.f.i.1","label":"1.","text":"Composition/ Strength: 8-10 personnel, with 6-8x AK-47 (Rifle) and 2x RPK (light machine gun)","page":2,"level":3},{"id":"1.f.i.2","label":"2.","text":"Disposition: 1 Olvana Army Forces SQD conducting team sized ambushes within the AO.","page":2,"level":3},{"id":"1.f.ii","label":"ii.","text":"Recent Activities: Olvana Army Forces have increased the frequency in ambushes on US Forces within the last 72 hours to regain control of the AO and reconsolidate their degraded formations.","page":2,"level":2},{"id":"1.f.iii","label":"iii.","text":"MLCOA: The Enemy will defend multiple intersections along MSR Box Springs and ambush USF. ENY Main Effort (ME) will destroy USF in the Killzone. ENY SE 1 will fix USF in the Killzone IOT prevent envelopment of the ENY ME. ENY SE 2 will disrupt USF IOT prevent envelopment of the ENY ME.","page":2,"level":2},{"id":"1.f.iv","label":"iv.","text":"MDCOA: The ENY has consolidated all their combat power on K1 and have established a linear defense of the intersection. ENY ME will destroy USF along Red Diamond Road. ENY SE 1 will disrupt USF movement IOT ENY ME freedom of maneuver.","page":2,"level":2},{"id":"1.g","label":"g.","text":"Friendly Forces","page":2,"level":1},{"id":"1.g.i","label":"i.","text":"Higher HQ Mission and Intent (2 levels up):","page":2,"level":2},{"id":"1.g.i.1","label":"1.","text":"Mission: 3-11 IN attacks to clear AO STANDARDS NLT 310900JUL2026 in order to allow freedom of maneuver for follow on forces.","page":2,"level":3},{"id":"1.g.i.2","label":"2.","text":"Commander's Intent:","page":2,"level":3},{"id":"1.g.i.2.a","label":"a.","text":"Purpose: Control the high speed AoA's, and to set conditions to occupy the AO.","page":3,"level":4},{"id":"1.g.i.2.b","label":"b.","text":"Key Tasks:","page":3,"level":4},{"id":"1.g.i.2.b.i","label":"i.","text":"Clear all Objectives within assigned AO.","page":3,"level":5},{"id":"1.g.i.2.b.ii","label":"ii.","text":"Secure intersections of AoA's and Main Supply Routes (MSR).","page":3,"level":5},{"id":"1.g.i.2.b.iii","label":"iii.","text":"Postured with forces arrayed to occupy the AO","page":3,"level":5},{"id":"1.g.i.2.c","label":"c.","text":"End State:","page":3,"level":4},{"id":"1.g.i.2.c.i","label":"i.","text":"Enemy: Unable to deter or defeat US Forces.","page":3,"level":5},{"id":"1.g.i.2.c.ii","label":"ii.","text":"Terrain: Key Terrain is secured by US Forces.","page":3,"level":5},{"id":"1.g.i.2.c.iii","label":"iii.","text":"Civil: Civilian population and infrastructure preserved.","page":3,"level":5},{"id":"1.g.ii","label":"ii.","text":"Higher HQ Mission and Intent (1 level up):","page":3,"level":2},{"id":"1.g.ii.1","label":"1.","text":"Mission: A/3-11IN attacks to clear AO PATRIOT NLT 310700JUL2026 in order to allow freedom of maneuver for follow on forces.","page":3,"level":3},{"id":"1.g.ii.2","label":"2.","text":"Commander's Intent: We will accomplish the BN's ME by clearing the AO of Olvana Forces and gaining a stronger foothold within the AO. This will allow for US Forces to occupy, control the intersections of AoA's, and move Command and Control further into the AO.","page":3,"level":3},{"id":"1.g.ii.2.a","label":"a.","text":"Purpose: Control high speed AoA's, and to set conditions to occupy AO.","page":3,"level":4},{"id":"1.g.ii.2.b","label":"b.","text":"Key Tasks:","page":3,"level":4},{"id":"1.g.ii.2.b.i","label":"i.","text":"Clear OBJ Black and OBJ Gold.","page":3,"level":5},{"id":"1.g.ii.2.b.ii","label":"ii.","text":"Secure intersections of AoA's and MSR's.","page":3,"level":5},{"id":"1.g.ii.2.b.iii","label":"iii.","text":"Posture Company Command Post (CP) to set conditions to further occupy AO.","page":3,"level":5},{"id":"1.g.ii.2.c","label":"c.","text":"End State:","page":3,"level":4},{"id":"1.g.ii.2.c.i","label":"i.","text":"Enemy: Cleared from all OBJ's, unable to deter, or defeat US Forces.","page":3,"level":5},{"id":"1.g.ii.2.c.ii","label":"ii.","text":"Terrain: Key Terrain is secured by US Forces.","page":3,"level":5},{"id":"1.g.ii.2.c.iii","label":"iii.","text":"Civil: Civilian population and infrastructure preserved.","page":3,"level":5},{"id":"1.g.iii","label":"iii.","text":"Adjacent Units:","page":3,"level":2},{"id":"1.g.iii.1","label":"1.","text":"1/A: (SE2)","page":3,"level":3},{"id":"1.g.iii.1.a","label":"a.","text":"Task: Secure the Company CP","page":3,"level":4},{"id":"1.g.iii.1.b","label":"b.","text":"Purpose: in order to prevent enemy infiltration into CP.","page":3,"level":4},{"id":"1.g.iii.2","label":"2.","text":"2/A: (SE1)","page":3,"level":3},{"id":"1.g.iii.2.a","label":"a.","text":"Task: Clear OBJ Gold","page":3,"level":4},{"id":"1.g.iii.2.b","label":"b.","text":"Purpose: in order to prevent envelopment of the ME.","page":3,"level":4},{"id":"1.g.iii.3","label":"3.","text":"3/A: (ME)","page":4,"level":3},{"id":"1.g.iii.3.a","label":"a.","text":"Task: Clear OBJ Black","page":4,"level":4},{"id":"1.g.iii.3.b","label":"b.","text":"Purpose: in order to allow freedom of maneuver for follow on forces.","page":4,"level":4},{"id":"1.g.iv","label":"iv.","text":"Attachments/ Detachments: 1 x machine gun team will be assigned to each assault SQD. Effective at the PLT ORP.","page":4,"level":2},{"id":"2","label":"2.","text":"Mission: 3rd Platoon, A Company attacks to clear OBJ Black in vicinity of 16S GA 1509 8050 NLT 310500JUL2026 in order to allow freedom of maneuver within the AO.","page":4,"level":0},{"id":"3","label":"3.","text":"Execution:","page":4,"level":0},{"id":"3.a","label":"a.","text":"Commander's Intent: No Change from Company Commanders Intent.","page":4,"level":1},{"id":"3.b","label":"b.","text":"Concept of the Operation:","page":4,"level":1},{"id":"3.b.i","label":"i.","text":"The Purpose of this operation is to allow freedom of maneuver within the AO. We will accomplish this by conducting penetration. Decisive to this operation is destruction of an enemy Fire Team and 2x RPKs. This is decisive because it allows the freedom of maneuver within the AO for friendly elements. The risk assessed is maneuvering within enemy MELs (Maximum Engagement Line) without suppression. We will mitigate this risk by utilizing the intervisibility lines enroute to the OBJ.","page":4,"level":2},{"id":"3.b.ii","label":"ii.","text":"Key Tasks:","page":4,"level":2},{"id":"3.b.ii.i","label":"i.","text":"Clear OBJ Black.","page":4,"level":3},{"id":"3.b.ii.ii","label":"ii.","text":"Secure intersections of AoA's and MSR's.","page":4,"level":3},{"id":"3.b.ii.iii","label":"iii.","text":"Posture Company Command Post (CP) to set conditions to further occupy AO.","page":4,"level":3},{"id":"3.b.iii","label":"iii.","text":"End State:","page":4,"level":2},{"id":"3.b.iii.i","label":"i.","text":"Enemy: Cleared from all OBJ's, unable to deter, or defeat US Forces.","page":4,"level":3},{"id":"3.b.iii.ii","label":"ii.","text":"Terrain: key terrain is secured by US Forces.","page":4,"level":3},{"id":"3.b.iii.iii","label":"iii.","text":"Civil: Civilian population and infrastructure preserved.","page":4,"level":3},{"id":"3.c","label":"c.","text":"Scheme of Movement and Maneuver:","page":4,"level":1},{"id":"3.c.i","label":"i.","text":"PHASE 1: Planning","page":4,"level":2},{"id":"3.c.i.1","label":"1.","text":"Begins: Receipt of OPORD","page":4,"level":3},{"id":"3.c.i.2","label":"2.","text":"Ends: Movement from the Company Assembly Area","page":4,"level":3},{"id":"3.c.i.3","label":"3.","text":"Key Tasks: Rehearsals, PCCs/PCIs, Redistribution of CL I/V","page":4,"level":3},{"id":"3.c.i.4","label":"4.","text":"OOM will be 2nd SQD, 1st SQD, 3rd SQD","page":4,"level":3},{"id":"3.c.ii","label":"ii.","text":"PHASE 2: Movement","page":4,"level":2},{"id":"3.c.ii.1","label":"1.","text":"Begins: Movement from the Company Assembly Area","page":5,"level":3},{"id":"3.c.ii.2","label":"2.","text":"Ends: Establishment of Platoon ORP","page":5,"level":3},{"id":"3.c.ii.3","label":"3.","text":"Key Tasks: Leader's Reconnaissance of PLT ORP, Establishment of Platoon ORP (16S GA 136 814)","page":5,"level":3},{"id":"3.c.ii.4","label":"4.","text":"Third Platoon will move in a PLT column, SQD wedge southeast from the Company Assembly Area and conduct a short halt in the vicinity of Lafayette Road. From the short halt the platoon leader and 2 SQD will conduct a leader's recon of the PLT ORP in the vicinity of 16S GA 136 814. Upon completion of the recon, the PL will return to the short halt position and guide the remainder of the platoon into the ORP. 2nd SQD will occupy the 10 to 2 o'clock, 1st SQD will occupy 2 to 6 o'clock, and 3rd SQD will occupy the 6 to 10 o'clock. HQ will be located in the center of the ORP.","page":5,"level":3},{"id":"3.c.ii.5","label":"5.","text":"OOM: 2nd SQD, 1st SQD, 3rd SQD","page":5,"level":3},{"id":"3.c.iii","label":"iii.","text":"PHASE 3: Blocking of OBJ Red and Blue","page":5,"level":2},{"id":"3.c.iii.1","label":"1.","text":"Begins: Establishment of PLT ORP","page":5,"level":3},{"id":"3.c.iii.2","label":"2.","text":"Ends: Blocking of OBJ Red and Blue","page":5,"level":3},{"id":"3.c.iii.3","label":"3.","text":"Key Tasks: Leader's Reconnaissance of OBJ Red and Blue","page":5,"level":3},{"id":"3.c.iii.4","label":"4.","text":"NLT 310100JUL2026. 2nd SQD will conduct a leader's recon of OBJ RED with the PL and 1st SQD will recon BLUE with the PSG. Upon returning from the leader's recon, 2nd SQD moves to OBJ RED, 1st SQD moves to OBJ BLUE, and 3rd SQD moves to occupy an ASLT position west of PL BUD. 2nd SQD orients their blocking position to the north on OBJ RED in vicinity of Key Terrain 1 and 1st SQD orients their blocking position to the south on OBJ BLUE.","page":5,"level":3},{"id":"3.c.iii.5","label":"5.","text":"OOM: 2nd SQD, 1st SQD, 3rd SQD","page":5,"level":3},{"id":"3.c.iv","label":"iv.","text":"PHASE 4: Clearance of OBJ WHITE","page":5,"level":2},{"id":"3.c.iv.1","label":"1.","text":"Begins: Blocking of OBJ RED and BLUE","page":5,"level":3},{"id":"3.c.iv.2","label":"2.","text":"Ends: Clearance of OBJ WHITE","page":5,"level":3},{"id":"3.c.iv.3","label":"3.","text":"Key Tasks: Leaders Reconnaissance of OBJ WHITE, Establishment of Support by Fire, Clearance of OBJ WHITE, and Shift and Lift signals, EPW search","page":5,"level":3},{"id":"3.c.iv.4","label":"4.","text":"On Order, 3rd SQD will move east across PL BUD and Clear OBJ White. PL COORS will be active as the RFL to the OBJ Blue.","page":5,"level":3},{"id":"3.c.v","label":"v.","text":"PHASE 5:","page":5,"level":2},{"id":"3.c.v.1","label":"1.","text":"Begins: Clearance of OBJ WHITE","page":5,"level":3},{"id":"3.c.v.2","label":"2.","text":"Ends: Establishment of Hasty Battle Position on OBJ WHITE","page":5,"level":3},{"id":"3.c.v.3","label":"3.","text":"Key Tasks: Reconsolidation and Reorganization, CASEVAC/EPW Operations, Redistribution of CL I/V","page":5,"level":3},{"id":"3.c.v.4","label":"4.","text":"3rd SQD will establish a hasty battle position oriented to east. 2nd SQD and 1st SQD will remain at their blocking positons. On Order, 1st SQD will reinforce OBJ WHITE.","page":6,"level":3},{"id":"3.d","label":"d.","text":"Scheme of Fires:","page":6,"level":1},{"id":"3.d.i","label":"i.","text":"Target: AA0005","page":6,"level":2},{"id":"3.d.ii","label":"ii.","text":"Trigger: ENY reinforcement on OBJ RED","page":6,"level":2},{"id":"3.d.iii","label":"iii.","text":"Location: 16S GA 1615 8075","page":6,"level":2},{"id":"3.d.iv","label":"iv.","text":"Observer: 2nd SL (PRI) 2nd SQD ATL (ALT)","page":6,"level":2},{"id":"3.d.v","label":"v.","text":"Delivery System: 60 mm Mortar","page":6,"level":2},{"id":"3.d.vi","label":"vi.","text":"Attack guidance: 4 rounds HEPD.","page":6,"level":2},{"id":"3.d.vii","label":"vii.","text":"Communication: P: CO Fires Net A: CO CMD Net","page":6,"level":2},{"id":"3.e","label":"e.","text":"Tasks to Subordinate Units:","page":6,"level":1},{"id":"3.e.i","label":"i.","text":"2/3/A (SE1) T: Block intersection on OBJ RED (16S GA 1529 8195) P: Deny enemy Freedom of Maneuver in AO","page":6,"level":2},{"id":"3.e.ii","label":"ii.","text":"1/3/A (SE2) T: Block intersection on OBJ BLUE (16S GA 1475 8000) P: Deny Enemy Freedom of Maneuver in AO","page":6,"level":2},{"id":"3.e.iii","label":"iii.","text":"3/3/A (ME) T: Clear OBJ WHITE (16S GA 1509 8050) P: Provide Freedom of Maneuver for Company ME in the AO","page":6,"level":2},{"id":"3.f","label":"f.","text":"Coordinating instructions:","page":6,"level":1},{"id":"3.f.i","label":"i.","text":"Timeline:","page":6,"level":2},{"id":"3.f.i.1","label":"","text":"300800JUL2026 :: Supply Request Due","page":6,"level":3},{"id":"3.f.i.2","label":"","text":"300800JUL2026 :: PCIs","page":6,"level":3},{"id":"3.f.i.3","label":"","text":"301000JUL2026 :: SQD Rehearsals","page":6,"level":3},{"id":"3.f.i.4","label":"","text":"301100JUL2026 :: Supply Draw","page":6,"level":3},{"id":"3.f.i.5","label":"","text":"301300JUL2026 :: PLT Rehearsals","page":6,"level":3},{"id":"3.f.i.6","label":"","text":"301400JUL2026 :: PCCs","page":6,"level":3},{"id":"3.f.i.7","label":"","text":"301700JUL2026 :: SP From CO","page":6,"level":3},{"id":"3.f.i.8","label":"","text":"302100JUL2026 :: PLT ORP Established","page":6,"level":3},{"id":"3.f.i.9","label":"","text":"302300JUL2026 :: Leaders Recon","page":6,"level":3},{"id":"3.f.i.10","label":"","text":"310100JUL2026 :: 1st SQD Blocking Position Established","page":6,"level":3},{"id":"3.f.i.11","label":"","text":"310100JUL2026 :: 2nd SQD Blocking Position Established","page":6,"level":3},{"id":"3.f.i.12","label":"","text":"310500JUL2026 :: NLT 3rd SQD Clearance of OBJ White","page":6,"level":3},{"id":"3.f.ii","label":"ii.","text":"Commander's Critical Information Requirements:","page":6,"level":2},{"id":"3.f.ii.1","label":"1.","text":"Priority Information Requirements","page":6,"level":3},{"id":"3.f.ii.1.a","label":"a.","text":"Size of ENY forces on assigned Objectives","page":6,"level":4},{"id":"3.f.ii.1.b","label":"b.","text":"Presence of ENY forces within AO","page":6,"level":4},{"id":"3.f.ii.1.c","label":"c.","text":"Presence of ENY forces larger than a SQD size within the AO.","page":6,"level":4},{"id":"3.f.ii.2","label":"2.","text":"Friendly Forces Information Requirements:","page":6,"level":3},{"id":"3.f.ii.2.a","label":"a.","text":"Loss of crew served weapon","page":6,"level":4},{"id":"3.f.ii.2.b","label":"b.","text":"Casualties requiring MEDEVAC","page":7,"level":4},{"id":"3.f.ii.2.c","label":"c.","text":"Loss of a key leader (SL/ATL/BTL)","page":7,"level":4},{"id":"3.f.ii.2.d","label":"d.","text":"Failure to meet NLT mission time","page":7,"level":4},{"id":"3.f.ii.2.e","label":"e.","text":"Patrol compromised during movement","page":7,"level":4},{"id":"3.f.ii.3","label":"3.","text":"Essential Elements of Friendly Information:","page":7,"level":3},{"id":"3.f.ii.3.a","label":"a.","text":"Location of PLT ORP","page":7,"level":4},{"id":"3.f.ii.3.b","label":"b.","text":"Presence of US Forces within AO prior to 3rd SQD initiation of assault on OBJ WHITE.","page":7,"level":4},{"id":"3.f.iii","label":"iii.","text":"Fire Support Coordination Measures:","page":7,"level":2},{"id":"3.f.iii.1","label":"1.","text":"Plan and use TRP's when executing an attack on ENY Positions in order to de-conflict support by fire from the assaulting element.","page":7,"level":3},{"id":"3.f.iii.2","label":"2.","text":"PL COORS is an RFL for 3rd SQD and is active with OBJ Blue is blocked.","page":7,"level":3},{"id":"3.f.iv","label":"iv.","text":"Rules of Engagement:","page":7,"level":2},{"id":"3.f.iv.1","label":"1.","text":"First use of deadly force against enemy forces is authorized.","page":7,"level":3},{"id":"3.f.iv.2","label":"2.","text":"Every soldier has the right to self-defense.","page":7,"level":3},{"id":"3.f.iv.3","label":"3.","text":"All enemy facilities and equipment may be attacked, except medical/ religious facilities/ equipment.","page":7,"level":3},{"id":"4","label":"4.","text":"Sustainment:","page":7,"level":0},{"id":"4.a","label":"a.","text":"Logistics:","page":7,"level":1},{"id":"4.a.i","label":"i.","text":"Supply:","page":7,"level":2},{"id":"4.a.i.1","label":"1.","text":"Class I: Deployment ration cycle is M-M-M. Deploy with 8 qt. of water per soldier.","page":7,"level":3},{"id":"4.a.i.2","label":"2.","text":"Class V: Deploy with minimum 1x basic load per weapon system (M4x210, M320x12, M249x1000, and M240Bx1200). Tailor your requests to your mission. Request additional ammunition during re-supply operations with the Platoon Sergeant (A-7).","page":7,"level":3},{"id":"4.a.i.3","label":"3.","text":"Class VIII: Request additional medical supplies through the PSG; he will coordinate with BN Aid Station.","page":7,"level":3},{"id":"4.a.ii","label":"ii.","text":"Personnel:","page":7,"level":2},{"id":"4.a.ii.1","label":"1.","text":"Enemy Prisoner of War: Handle all enemy prisoners as per the 5S&T Method. (Search, Silence. Segregate, Safeguard, Speed to the Rear, and Tag.) Immediately inform the Platoon Leader or Platoon Sergeant of captured enemy and coordinate for an EPW exchange point or consolidate at the PLT ORP.","page":7,"level":3},{"id":"4.a.iii","label":"iii.","text":"Health System Support","page":7,"level":2},{"id":"4.a.iii.1","label":"1.","text":"Medical Command and Control:","page":7,"level":3},{"id":"4.a.iii.1.a","label":"a.","text":"PLT Casualty Collection Point (CCP1) will be located at the PLT ORP and controlled by the PSG. MEDEVAC requests will be passed on the CMD NET.","page":7,"level":4},{"id":"4.a.iii.1.b","label":"b.","text":"CCP 2 will be activated upon clearance of OBJ White at 16S GA 1509 8050.","page":8,"level":4},{"id":"4.a.iii.2","label":"2.","text":"Medical treatment:","page":8,"level":3},{"id":"4.a.iii.2.a","label":"a.","text":"Following self-aid and buddy-aid, wounded will be stabilized by SQD Combat life saver and moved by SKEDCO to the PLT ORP/CCP with a security team.","page":8,"level":4},{"id":"4.a.iii.3","label":"3.","text":"Medical Evacuation","page":8,"level":3},{"id":"4.a.iii.3.a","label":"a.","text":"Air evacuation: available on request through CO CMD NET.","page":8,"level":4},{"id":"4.a.iii.3.b","label":"b.","text":"Ground evacuation: available on request through CO CMD NET.","page":8,"level":4},{"id":"5","label":"5.","text":"Command and Control:","page":8,"level":0},{"id":"5.a","label":"a.","text":"Command:","page":8,"level":1},{"id":"5.a.i","label":"i.","text":"Location of Command Post: 16S GA 1150 8230","page":8,"level":2},{"id":"5.a.ii","label":"ii.","text":"Location of Key Leaders:","page":8,"level":2},{"id":"5.a.ii.1","label":"1.","text":"PL: OBJ WHITE","page":8,"level":3},{"id":"5.a.ii.2","label":"2.","text":"PSG: PLT ORP","page":8,"level":3},{"id":"5.a.ii.3","label":"3.","text":"1 SL: OBJ BLUE","page":8,"level":3},{"id":"5.a.ii.4","label":"4.","text":"2 SL: OBJ RED","page":8,"level":3},{"id":"5.a.ii.5","label":"5.","text":"3 SL: OBJ WHITE","page":8,"level":3},{"id":"5.a.ii.6","label":"6.","text":"4 SL (WSL): OBJ RED","page":8,"level":3},{"id":"5.a.ii.7","label":"","text":"Succession of command: PL-PSG-WSL-1SL-2SL-3SL","page":8,"level":3},{"id":"5.b","label":"b.","text":"Signal:","page":8,"level":1},{"id":"5.b.i","label":"i.","text":"Frequencies and Call signs","page":8,"level":2},{"id":"5.b.i.1","label":"1.","text":"Frequencies: PLT Net 51.500","page":8,"level":3},{"id":"5.b.i.2","label":"2.","text":"Call Signs:","page":8,"level":3},{"id":"5.b.i.2.a","label":"a.","text":"PL: ATTACK 3-6","page":8,"level":4},{"id":"5.b.i.2.b","label":"b.","text":"PSG: ATTACK 3-7","page":8,"level":4},{"id":"5.b.i.2.c","label":"c.","text":"1SL: ATTACK 3-1","page":8,"level":4},{"id":"5.b.i.2.d","label":"d.","text":"2SL: ATTACK 3-2","page":8,"level":4},{"id":"5.b.i.2.e","label":"e.","text":"3SL: ATTACK 3-3","page":8,"level":4},{"id":"5.b.i.2.f","label":"f.","text":"WSL: ATTACK 3-4","page":8,"level":4},{"id":"5.b.ii","label":"ii.","text":"Method of Communications by priority:","page":8,"level":2},{"id":"5.b.ii.1","label":"1.","text":"Primary: FM (PLT Net)","page":8,"level":3},{"id":"5.b.ii.2","label":"2.","text":"Alternate: Hand and Arm Signals","page":8,"level":3},{"id":"5.b.ii.3","label":"3.","text":"Contingency: Verbal","page":8,"level":3},{"id":"5.b.ii.4","label":"4.","text":"Emergency: Runner","page":8,"level":3},{"id":"5.b.iii","label":"iii.","text":"Pyrotechnics and signals","page":8,"level":2},{"id":"5.b.iii.1","label":"1.","text":"Recognition Signals","page":8,"level":3},{"id":"5.b.iii.1.a","label":"a.","text":"Near:","page":8,"level":4},{"id":"5.b.iii.1.a.i","label":"i.","text":"Day: VS-17 Panel (IAW Number Combo)","page":9,"level":5},{"id":"5.b.iii.1.a.ii","label":"ii.","text":"Night: IR Flash (IAW Number Combo)","page":9,"level":5},{"id":"5.b.iii.1.b","label":"b.","text":"Far:","page":9,"level":4},{"id":"5.b.iii.1.b.i","label":"i.","text":"Day: FM","page":9,"level":5},{"id":"5.b.iii.1.b.ii","label":"ii.","text":"Night: FM","page":9,"level":5},{"id":"5.b.iv","label":"iv.","text":"Challenge and Password: ULTIMATE / FRISBEE","page":9,"level":2},{"id":"5.b.v","label":"v.","text":"Number Combination: 7","page":9,"level":2},{"id":"5.b.vi","label":"vi.","text":"Running Password: STANDARDS","page":9,"level":2},{"id":"5.c","label":"c.","text":"Reports:","page":9,"level":1},{"id":"5.c.i","label":"i.","text":"ENY Contact made","page":9,"level":2},{"id":"5.c.ii","label":"ii.","text":"SALUTE reports","page":9,"level":2},{"id":"5.c.iii","label":"iii.","text":"ACE","page":9,"level":2},{"id":"5.c.iv","label":"iv.","text":"9-Line Medevac","page":9,"level":2},{"id":"5.c.v","label":"v.","text":"ORP Establishment","page":9,"level":2},{"id":"5.c.vi","label":"vi.","text":"SP","page":9,"level":2},{"id":"5.c.vii","label":"vii.","text":"LDA Crossing","page":9,"level":2},{"id":"5.c.viii","label":"viii.","text":"Battle Damage Assessment","page":9,"level":2},{"id":"5.c.ix","label":"ix.","text":"Recon","page":9,"level":2}]},"annex":[{"id":"A-PLT","title":"Annex A · Platoon Task Organization","items":[{"unit":"3/A/3-11 (ME)","text":"OBJ BLACK. Task: Clear. Purpose: in order to allow freedom of maneuver (FOM) in the AO."},{"unit":"1/3/A/3-11 (SE2)","text":"OBJ BLUE. Task: Block. Purpose: in order to deny enemy freedom of maneuver in the AO."},{"unit":"2/3/A/3-11 (SE1)","text":"OBJ RED. Task: Block. Purpose: in order to deny enemy freedom of maneuver in the AO."},{"unit":"3/3/A/3-11 (ME)","text":"OBJ WHITE. Task: Clear. Purpose: in order to Allow FOM of CO ME in the AO."},{"unit":"WPN (GUN1)","text":"Attached to 1/3/A/3-11 (dashed line)."},{"unit":"WPN (GUN2)","text":"Attached to 2/3/A/3-11 (dashed line)."},{"unit":"WPN (GUN3)","text":"Attached to 3/3/A/3-11 (dashed line)."}],"img":"annex/a1.jpg?v=99b615a7","page":1},{"id":"A-CO","title":"Annex A · Company Task Organization","items":[{"unit":"A/3-11 (ME)","text":"OBJ Patriot. Task: Clear. Purpose: Allow FOM for follow on forces."},{"unit":"1/A/3-11 (SE2)","text":"Task: Secure the Company CP. Purpose: Prevent enemy infiltration into the Company CP."},{"unit":"2/A/3-11 (SE1)","text":"OBJ GOLD. Task: Clear. Purpose: Deny enemy freedom of maneuver in the AO."},{"unit":"3/A/3-11 (ME)","text":"OBJ BLACK. Task: Clear. Purpose: Allow FOM for follow on forces."}],"img":"annex/a2.jpg?v=71988c4e","page":2},{"id":"B-TXT","title":"Annex B · ENY SITTEMP (narrative)","items":[{"unit":"ENY ME","text":"One US SQD moves into killzone and the AK-47s will fix USF between TRPs 1,2,3. USF will react to contact and begin to maneuver. Once USF have committed to the attack, the RPK will destroy one US SQD, reaching their decisive point."},{"unit":"ENY SE1","text":"As USF will move into killzone and begin to maneuver, SE1's RPK and AK-47s will fix US movement in the killzone IOT prevent envelopment of the ME."},{"unit":"Map","text":"AXP #07 at the Red Diamond Rd / Lafayette Rd junction; Daniels Pond; Anzio Rd; Cantigny Trl."}],"img":"annex/a3.jpg?v=e9ca82fa","page":3},{"id":"B-MAP","title":"Annex B · ENY SITTEMP (map)","items":[{"unit":"OLVANA TM (ME)","text":"At OBJ RED (K1). Task: Ambush US Forces. Purpose: in order to prevent build-up of US forces in the area."},{"unit":"OLVANA TM (SE1)","text":"At OBJ WHITE (K2). Task: Fix US Forces. Purpose: in order to prevent envelopment of ME."},{"unit":"OLVANA TM (SE2)","text":"At OBJ BLUE. Task: Disrupt US Forces. Purpose: in order to prevent envelopment of ME."}],"img":"annex/a4.jpg?v=c2154a6f","page":4},{"id":"C-PLT","title":"Annex C · 3rd Platoon Area of Operation (OBJ BLACK)","items":[{"unit":"2/3/A/3-11 (SE1)","text":"OBJ RED. Task: Block. Purpose: in order to deny enemy freedom of maneuver in the AO."},{"unit":"3/3/A/3-11 (ME)","text":"OBJ WHITE. Task: Clear. Purpose: in order to Allow FOM of CO DO in the AO."},{"unit":"1/3/A/3-11 (SE2)","text":"OBJ BLUE. Task: Block. Purpose: in order to deny enemy freedom of maneuver in the AO."},{"unit":"Olvana SQD (ME)","text":"Task: Ambush US Forces. Purpose: in order to prevent build-up of US forces in the area."},{"unit":"Graphics","text":"PL BUD (N–S, W of OBJ WHITE), PL COORS (S of OBJ WHITE), PLT ORP, OBJ RED / WHITE / BLUE, K at the Box Springs Rd intersections."}],"img":"annex/a5.jpg?v=51ba4ded","page":5},{"id":"C-SQD","title":"Annex C · 3rd Platoon, 3rd Squad Area of Operation (OBJ WHITE)","items":[{"unit":"OLVANA TM (ME)","text":"Task: Fix US Forces. Purpose: in order to prevent build-up of US forces in the area."},{"unit":"Graphics","text":"PL BUD, PL COORS, PLT ORP, OBJ WHITE, OBJ RED, OBJ BLUE."}],"img":"annex/a6.jpg?v=8f4816e1","page":6},{"id":"C-IMG","title":"Annex C · 3rd Squad Area of Operation (OBJ WHITE) – imagery","items":[{"unit":"Imagery","text":"Aerial photo of OBJ WHITE: Box Springs Rd running SW–NE through the intersection with Cantigny Trl; dense woods W of the road, thinned pines and an open clearing E of it."}],"img":"annex/a7.jpg?v=e6d6c8ad","page":7},{"id":"C-CO","title":"Annex C · Company Area of Operation (AO Patriot)","items":[{"unit":"1/A/3-11 (SE2)","text":"Task: Secure the Company CP. Purpose: in order to prevent enemy infiltration into the CP."},{"unit":"2/A/3-11 (SE1)","text":"Task: Clear (OBJ GOLD). Purpose: in order to deny enemy freedom of maneuver in the AO."},{"unit":"3/A/3-11 (ME)","text":"Task: Clear (OBJ BLACK). Purpose: in order to allow FOM of BN DO in the AO."},{"unit":"Olvana PLT (ME)","text":"Task: Ambush US Forces. Purpose: in order to prevent build-up of US forces in the area."}],"img":"annex/a8.jpg?v=0c989ed4","page":8}],"shell":[{"id":"WARNO","title":"WARNO · Initial planning timeline","items":["INITIAL PLANNING TIMELINE: (1/3 – 2/3)","Upper row: 1-UP. Lower row: OPERATIONAL.","Marks along the line: (1/3) · (2/3) · SP · NLT"]},{"id":"PG2","title":"PG 2 · AO / AI prompts","items":["ORIENT – (To general area): Cardinal Directions; Nearest/Largest Cities/Towns and/or Significant geographic features (i.e. rivers) with Distance & Direction","BOX – AO (Boundaries) (Terrain features, GCMs): North / South / East / West","TRACE – (Unit Boundaries, RTEs, PLs)","FAMILIARIZE – (KT, OBJs, CPs, other)","AI table: CAS/AVN · ARTY/MTR · RES · OTHER × Composition · Location · Trigger · Time/Range · Priority"]},{"id":"PG4","title":"PG 4 · GTAO checklist","items":["Key Terrain","Objective","Water Features","Restricted Terrain","Severely Restricted Terrain","Avenues of Approach","Obstacles"]},{"id":"PG12","title":"PG 12 · Complete the plan","items":["COA SKETCH CHECKLIST: Unit Boundaries · OBJ · ENY Battle Positions, WPNs, & Task · ASLT POS · SBF · SQD ORP · Friendly Unit Boxes (SQD, ATM, BTM) & Task · Decisive Point · TRPs/Targets · AoAs/DoAs (route plan from start to end) · PLT ORP/CO AA · Phase Lines with correct naming convention · HLZ, AXP, CCP","MICRO-OPS CHECKLIST: Unit Boundaries · OBJ · ASLT POS · SBF · SQD ORP · TRPs/Targets · AoAs/DoAs (route plan from SQD ORP to LOA2) · Phase Lines (AT Minimum: Shift, Cease, LOAs) with correct naming convention · CCPs/AXP/HLZ"]},{"id":"PG14","title":"PG 14–18 · Scheme of maneuver guidance","items":["Start to finish for all maneuver elements","Consider adding phase lines at major transitions in your plan","Be specific with details that matter to the execution of your plan","Do not fluff up your narrative with filler words, be clear and concise in articulating your plan","SOM accounts for friendly action, enemy reaction, and planned friendly counter action","Brief critical tasks by what needs doing, and who is doing it","Mass effects of combat power at the Decisive Point","Employ appropriate form of movement formation / techniques","Synchronize plan through end state","Incorporate elements of CASEVAC (CCP by phase, AXPs, MASSCAL criteria/plan)","Boxes per phase: Begins w/ · Ends w/ · Critical Tasks · Route Plan (Distance, Direction, Rally Points/Check Points) · FOOM (Formation, Order of Movement, Movement Technique) · Phase Lines (in order) · Weapons Control Status (WCS, Engagement Criteria)"]},{"id":"PG19","title":"PG 19 · Scheme of fires","items":["T · T · L · O · D · A · C (Target, Trigger, Location, Observer, Delivery system, Attack guidance, Communication)","*REDs: 115m, DANGER CLOSE","FOR OCS PURPOSES: Assume 1/3 distance, 60mm, HE, Friendlies in Prone (TC 3-21.76 TABLE 3-3)"]},{"id":"PG20","title":"PG 20 · Sustainment and command & signal","items":["COMMUNICATION PACE: P · A · C · E","SHIFT/CEASE PACE: P · A · C · E","Challenge and Password · Number Combination · Running Password · Near / Far Recognition","At completion of OPORD brief, highlight the next Hard Time, conduct a back brief, take questions, and synchronize watches."]},{"id":"REF","title":"Reference · Common Doctrinal Tasks & Purposes","items":["Enemy oriented: Ambush · Attack by Fire · Block · Breach · Bypass · Canalize · Contain · Defeat · Destroy · Disrupt · Exploit · Feint · Fix · Interdict · Neutralize · Penetrate · Recon · Rupture · Support by Fire","Terrain oriented: Clear · Control · Occupy · Recon · Retain · Secure · Seize","Friendly oriented: Breach · Cover · Disengage · Displace · Exfiltrate · Follow · Guard · Protect · Screen","Environmental (population) oriented: Assess the Population · Build/Restore Infrastructure · Coordinate w/ Civil Authorities · Influence Population · Liaison w/ Civil Authority · Transfer to Civilian Control","Purposes: Allow · Cause · Create · Deceive · Delay · Deny · Divert · Enable · Envelope · Expel · Facilitate · Find · Identify · Influence · Isolate · Locate · Observe · Open · Prevent · Preserve · Provide Early Warning · Support · Surprise"]}]};
